", \"s47\", \"s48\"],\n          \"entity_scope\": \"user\",\n          \"time_scope\": \"past\",\n          \"parent_versions\": {},\n          \"retract_ids\": [],\n          \"reason\": \"Multiple user statements and assistant responses across five conversations document the user's past creative activities and interests: composing original music (s6-s9, s14-s16), digital remixing (s43-s48), audio production (s12-s13), launching a podcast (s33-s40), and collaborative band experience (s24-s30). The user consistently expresses that creating music provides emotional expression, personal growth, and satisfaction, while collaborative work felt stifling. These sources collectively support a comprehensive summary of the user's past creative pursuits and expressed interests.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"unresolved\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}", "response_metadata": {"finish_reason": "stop", "refusal": null, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7272, "total_tokens": 7707, "completion_tokens": 435, "prompt_tokens_details": null, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": null, "accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null}}, "response_id": "chatcmpl-8fc941974e6745e6", "protocol": "plain"}, "response_ref": "00da7ffa2614aad82f96e94b997ea93e108163bb202c4b2c846cbb6ac4fba64b", "output_tokens_estimate": 572, "finish_reason": "stop", "refusal": null, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7272, "total_tokens": 7707, "completion_tokens": 435, "prompt_tokens_details": null, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": null, "accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null}}, "response_id": "chatcmpl-8fc941974e6745e6", "protocol": "plain", "sequence": 78, "elapsed_seconds": 59.424246072769165}
